+++ b/V46.55.1-RELEASE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@
+# BLUE CURRENT V46.55.1 — MARGIN INTELLIGENCE STARTUP HOTFIX
+
+## Issue
+Browser startup could stop with:
+
+`ReferenceError: marginIntelligenceCenterModule is not defined`
+
+The Margin Intelligence engine, center, HTML surface, and scripts were still present. The missing piece was its startup-registry declaration.
+
+## Fix
+Restores `marginIntelligenceCenterModule` registration in all three maintained app copies:
+- `client/js/app-v15.1.3.js`
+- `client/app-v15.1.3.js`
+- `app-v15.1.3.js`
+
+The registration initializes `marginIntelligenceCenter` through `createBlueCurrentMarginIntelligenceCenterModule` and declares its existing dependencies.
+
+No feature is removed.
+
+## Regression guard
+Adds `scripts/maintenance/test-v46.55.1-margin-intelligence-startup.js`.
+
+The test verifies:
+- Margin Intelligence registration exists in all three app copies
+- Margin Intelligence remains exported
+- no referenced `*Module` export is undefined
+- Margin Intelligence HTML/scripts remain present
+
+## Validation
+- Focused startup regression test passed.
+- Undefined module exports: 0.
+- All three app copies passed `node --check`.
+- `npm run check` passed:
+  - 837 JavaScript files
+  - 716 client scripts
+  - 5,333 unique HTML IDs
+- Server startup passed as V46.55.1.
+- `/api/health` returned HTTP 200.
+- Database connected and authentication enabled.
+- Authoritative runtime database SHA-256 remained unchanged.
